      "form_guide": "",
      "comment": "SHIMMERING MISS (4) tends to take a while to wind up, running on to place two back before spotting a start latest and finishing on strongly into second (16.96) in a Grade 5 at this track. Must come into calculations. BONEY MALONEY (3) shapes well for this backing up a quick 18.89 win with success at this track over 350m last time, recording 19.12. Recent form strong for this and rates a key player again. FEDERAL NOTICE (7) was out of the placings last time when eighth at Townsville (22.44) but scored five back at Richmond (18.06). Has a solid record over this journey. Got the money at her only try from this box. Will give the top chances plenty to think about. YAPPING ACES (2) has a solid strike rate at this track and distance.",
